{"seq":1,"slug":"deduplication","title":"去重：精确、模糊与语义","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-frontier-research/pretraining-data-engineering/cleaning-filtering/deduplication","wordCount":1940,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"去重-精确-模糊与语义\">去重：精确、模糊与语义</h1><p>C4 语料里有一句 61 个单词的英文句子被原样重复了六万次以上——这不是都市传说，而是 <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2107.06499\">Lee 等人的去重研究</a>实际定位并删除的样本。同一篇论文还发现，未做去重的语料训练出的模型，有超过百分之一的自由生成内容是从训练集逐字背出来的。重复文本对语言模型不是中性噪声：它放大记忆、扭曲损失曲面，还让评测分数带上水分。去重因此从&quot;锦上添花的清洗步骤&quot;升级为预训练管道的标准组件。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>去重方案按&quot;判定什么算相同&quot;分为三个互补的层次。精确层处理字节级一致，模糊层处理改写级相似，语义层处理表达不同但含义趋同。生产管道几乎总是三层叠加：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;原始文档流&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;规范化&lt;br/&gt;Unicode / 空白 / 大小写&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;精确去重&lt;br/&gt;文档哈希&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;模糊去重&lt;br/&gt;MinHash + LSH 分桶&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;子串级清理&lt;br/&gt;后缀数组长重复&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; F{&quot;语义层可选&quot;}&#10;    F --&gt;|&quot;嵌入聚类&quot;| G[&quot;簇内修剪&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt;|&quot;跳过&quot;| H[&quot;输出去重语料&quot;]&#10;    G --&gt; H\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"原始文档流\"] --&gt; B[\"规范化&lt;br/&gt;Unicode / 空白 / 大小写\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"精确去重&lt;br/&gt;文档哈希\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"模糊去重&lt;br/&gt;MinHash + LSH 分桶\"]\n    D --&gt; E[\"子串级清理&lt;br/&gt;后缀数组长重复\"]\n    E --&gt; F{\"语义层可选\"}\n    F --&gt;|\"嵌入聚类\"| G[\"簇内修剪\"]\n    F --&gt;|\"跳过\"| H[\"输出去重语料\"]\n    G --&gt; H</pre><p>三个层次的工程画像差异很大，选型时要同时看捕获对象和计算成本：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层次</th>\n<th>捕获对象</th>\n<th>核心算法</th>\n<th>相对成本</th>\n<th>典型副作用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>精确</td>\n<td>字节一致的模板页</td>\n<td>规范化 + 哈希</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>模糊</td>\n<td>改写 / 转载 / 多模板</td>\n<td>MinHash+LSH、SimHash</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>误删合法相似文</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>子串</td>\n<td>文档内外的重复段落</td>\n<td>后缀数组</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>切除破坏连贯</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>语义</td>\n<td>同义不同形</td>\n<td>嵌入 + 聚类</td>\n<td>最高</td>\n<td>削弱表达多样性</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"精确去重-规范化决定一切\">精确去重：规范化决定一切</h2><p>精确去重的唯一技术要点在哈希之前：先做规范化。Unicode 归一化（NFKC）、统一大小写、压缩连续空白、剥离首尾标点之后，大量&quot;看似不同&quot;的文档会坍缩成同一指纹——爬虫缓存变体、编码转换产物、模板渲染的空白差异都靠这一步消灭。实现上用 128 位以上的哈希（MD5 在此场景够用但建议换 SHA 系列），配合布隆过滤器或排序去重在单机即可完成。它的盲区同样明确：只要改动一个字符，指纹就完全失效，而互联网转载恰恰以改动为常态。</p>\n<h2 id=\"模糊去重-minhash-与局部敏感哈希\">模糊去重：MinHash 与局部敏感哈希</h2><p>把文档表示为其 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span>-gram 集合（shingle），两篇文档的相似度用 Jaccard 系数量化：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>J</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>∩</mo><mi>B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>∪</mo><mi>B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">J(A,B) = \\frac{|A \\cap B|}{|A \\cup B|}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∪</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∩</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>直接两两比较是平方复杂度，MinHash 的价值在于把 Jaccard 变成可采样的随机变量：一个随机哈希函数下，两集合最小哈希值相等的概率恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>J</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">J(A,B)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，于是每篇文档用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 个哈希压成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 维签名后，签名一致率就是 Jaccard 的无偏估计。进一步用分带技巧（b 个 band × 每 band r 行）把&quot;候选对筛选&quot;降到近似线性：两文档至少在一个 band 内签名完全一致才进入精比，其成为候选的概率为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>cand</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>J</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>J</mi><mrow><mtext> </mtext><mi>r</mi></mrow></msup><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mi>b</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{\\text{cand}}(J) = 1 - \\left(1 - J^{\\,r}\\right)^{b}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">cand</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.239em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7144em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mspace mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1952em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.989em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>调节 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 就移动了相似度阈值处的曲线陡峭度。工程实现上还有两笔账要算。其一是签名存储：全局去重要为每篇文档持久化 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 维签名，百亿文档乘以数百字节就是 TB 级预算，实践中用签名聚类后的簇代表替代全量保留可以压缩一个数量级。其二是候选对的精比成本：分带筛选产生的候选对数量对阈值极度敏感，阈值调松一档可能让精比阶段膨胀十倍，因此阈值消融必须连同下游基准一起做，而不能只看去重率本身。FineWeb 的消融实验显示，仅 MinHash 去重一项就能带来可测量的基准提升；RefinedWeb 团队更激进，报告其过滤加去重流程从 Common Crawl 留下的五万亿 token 中仍持续受益于全局而非局部的去重范围（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2306.01116\">RefinedWeb</a>）。实践中的关键超参还有作用域：全局去重跨快照执行才能拦住季度性转载风暴，但需要持久化全部签名的存储预算。</p>\n<p>误删的代价同样需要定价。合法的相似文本——同一事件的平衡报道、教材的不同版本、系列文章的章节——与恶意转载在 Jaccard 空间里并无本质区别，阈值一刀切必然伤及前者。缓解思路有二：按来源域名差异化阈值（权威首发源放宽、聚合农场收紧），以及在删除前保留相似簇的元数据供事后审计恢复。这些机制把去重从一个不可逆的黑盒操作变成可申诉的流程。</p>\n<h2 id=\"子串级去重-后缀数组的长刀\">子串级去重：后缀数组的长刀</h2><p>有些重复不足以致整篇文档相似——一句免责声明、一段新闻通稿导语会在数十万文档中反复出现。这类污染要用子串粒度的工具：对全语料构建后缀数组，找出出现次数超过阈值的最长重复子串并删除或掩蔽。上述 61 词句子正是这种方法的战果。它同时是<a href=\"benchmark-decontamination\">评测去污染</a>的主力武器——基准题目与训练集的重叠往往只覆盖题干片段而非整页。代价是内存与工程复杂度：百 GB 级文本的后缀数组构建需要精心设计的外存算法，因此多数团队只在最终语料上跑一次。</p>\n<h2 id=\"语义去重-当-意思相同-也算重复\">语义去重：当&quot;意思相同&quot;也算重复</h2><p>SemDeDup 路线把去重推进到表示空间：对文档计算嵌入向量，聚类后在簇内按向量距离修剪冗余成员，保留簇代表（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2303.09540\">SemDeDup</a>）。它捕捉的是模糊方法看不见的冗余——同一新闻事件的千篇改写、数学题的换皮变体。风险也随之而来：语义相近不等于信息冗余，少数群体的非主流表述可能因为嵌入空间里的&quot;靠近多数&quot;而被系统性剪掉。因此语义层通常只用于高价值小语料或合成数据清洗，不做全网默认开启，且剪枝比例需要对照下游多样性指标校准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"去重的账本效应\">去重的账本效应</h2><p>阈值调优有一套可复用的三步法：先固定签名参数、扫出阈值曲线的完整形状；再对每档候选阈值抽样人工复核被删簇，标定误删率；最后与下游基准联动消融，而不是只盯着去重率本身。跳过任何一步，你调出的都只是&quot;看起来更干净&quot;的参数。</p>\n<p>去重对训练的影响可以总结为三条经验规律。第一，记忆化输出显著减少，隐私与版权暴露面随之收窄。第二，训练效率提升：Lee 等人报告去重后达到同等精度所需训练量可缩短近一半，等价于白捡算力。第三，也是最容易忽略的一条——去重缩减了<strong>唯一 token 的总量</strong>，这直接改变<a href=\"../mixtures-curriculum/data-scaling-behavior\">数据侧扩展行为</a>里的重复轮次预算：语料越干净，越早撞上数据墙。它与<a href=\"quality-filtering\">质量过滤</a>的先后顺序同样重要：先删垃圾再找重复，MinHash 签名的信噪比会好得多。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>精确、模糊、子串、语义四层各管一段相似谱系，按成本递增顺序串联成管道。</li>\n<li>MinHash 加 LSH 是性价比主力；后缀数组负责长重复与去污染；语义聚类只在可控规模启用。</li>\n<li>去重同时改写有效数据总量与记忆暴露面——把它当独立超参数消融，而非固定流水线一环。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"去重：精确、模糊与语义","id":"去重-精确-模糊与语义"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"精确去重：规范化决定一切","id":"精确去重-规范化决定一切"},{"level":2,"text":"模糊去重：MinHash 与局部敏感哈希","id":"模糊去重-minhash-与局部敏感哈希"},{"level":2,"text":"子串级去重：后缀数组的长刀","id":"子串级去重-后缀数组的长刀"},{"level":2,"text":"语义去重：当\"意思相同\"也算重复","id":"语义去重-当-意思相同-也算重复"},{"level":2,"text":"去重的账本效应","id":"去重的账本效应"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"策展来源：书籍、代码与论文","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-frontier-research/pretraining-data-engineering/acquisition/curated-sources"},"next":{"title":"质量过滤：从启发式到模型打分","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-frontier-research/pretraining-data-engineering/cleaning-filtering/quality-filtering"}}